// Redesigned per teacher feedback: professional, printable, single-page-per-day
// overview table with 7 clean columns.  All periods for the day render in ONE
// continuous table; the browser + Puppeteer respect break-inside:avoid on each
// row so long rows never split across pages, and the header repeats on every
// page (`thead { display: table-header-group }`).
